{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（12日）早上7時27分，警方接報一名女子在秀茂坪近曉華大廈對開路面，遭3名男子持木棍襲擊受傷，歹徒逞兇後逃去。救援人員到場，事主全身多處受傷、手部骨折，由救護車送往聯合醫院治理。警方正追緝3名涉案人士。</p><p>現場消息指，女事主為南亞裔人士，在地面近升降機位置遇襲，現場遺下血漬。事發後事主的丈夫及3名子女到場了解事件；據了解事件涉及感情糾紛。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場升降機外遺下血漬。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197466737034399744807145.jpeg/T3-0k4hYFL5vEBdO1C_If-RDnWypiGBBr-4tsYruLbE\"/><figcaption>現場升降機外遺下血漬。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員向事主的丈夫（戴帽者）了解事件。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197466734236667904062714.jpeg/Nt_Vpbl2AwrzjefOnCeuUdhYjRXjXlHUFIEB2DGBAdg\"/><figcaption>警員向事主的丈夫（戴帽者）了解事件。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名女子遭3名男子持木棍襲擊，其丈夫及子女到場。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197466730428108800790325.jpeg/Zk6NYyo2mCRkVQX7kLNFccsnNN8SYHHDJqb0mwOm9Js\"/><figcaption>一名女子遭3名男子持木棍襲擊，其丈夫及子女到場。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名女子遭3名男子持木棍襲擊，其丈夫及子女到場。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197466727475187712162835.jpeg/SeaXR-KqELkRAdlPPSaWgMBjG62KuAHZJIfUhwGH1Ic\"/><figcaption>一名女子遭3名男子持木棍襲擊，其丈夫及子女到場。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197466723305918464504786.jpeg/ADvDFs0LFyl9rU3Op0T3Jg1Sqf6qaTgMv3jAK5p4wCs\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T01:06:54.418895+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T00:41:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T03:37:26.487113+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T01:00:15.605570+00:00","content_hash":"95add1f5ea8d82439ff917ea2f84db8cba5595aaf0e3ab35b69255ceb6916961","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}